{"fetchedAt":"2026-10-30T01:10:27.989Z","pushedAt":"2026-08-11T03:19:54Z","branch":"main","issues":0,"watchers":0,"size":34920,"homepage":null,"archived":false,"files":54,"truncated":false,"readme":{"path":"README.md","html":"<h2 id=\"沐阳插画-skills\">沐阳插画 Skills</h2>\n<p>一套面向 Codex 的中文插画生成技能合集，包含 <strong>1 个总入口、8 个风格子技能、25 套固定提示词配方</strong>。\n<img width=\"1983\" height=\"793\" alt=\"exec-f4a5c2fb-79a3-43e7-a744-d849ce8192b6\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a3f4ef1-9f28-47bd-b727-196eaab66f76\" />\n<img width=\"1983\" height=\"793\" alt=\"exec-828069ee-2df2-43fb-bfb5-9c92812c3e0f\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b942054c-cad1-4e5a-8dc9-a039a7ab3dec\" />\n<img width=\"1983\" height=\"793\" alt=\"exec-f872dc86-056f-4d25-ac79-736162f94251\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3023d076-476a-4817-a291-fabff8ef7067\" />\n<img width=\"1983\" height=\"793\" alt=\"exec-d4b8888c-69a3-4ab3-a81d-7be5b9521cba\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/faea0134-2119-4a29-acea-a2e7413759ab\" />\n<img width=\"1983\" height=\"793\" alt=\"exec-05c0384b-98ff-4b8a-acd6-5b3e360cf665\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8658fb17-591c-4c24-ae1f-469f7a1e2221\" /></p>\n<p>用户只需指定主体与具体风格。Skill 会在内部套用固定配方并直接生成图片，不展示中间提示词，也不会擅自扩写主体或混合风格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"特点\">特点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>25 种经过分类的固定插画风格</li>\n<li>每种风格对应独立提示词配方与示意图</li>\n<li>主体内容由用户明确提供，避免模型自行改写</li>\n<li>主体与风格齐全后直接生成图片</li>\n<li>支持从总入口选择，也可直接调用子技能</li>\n<li>中文描述与中文交互</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"安装\">安装</h2>\n<p>将仓库克隆到本地：</p>\n<pre><code>git clone https://github.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills.git\n</code></pre>\n<p>复制 <code>skills/</code> 下的 9 个目录到 Codex Skills 目录。</p>\n<p>macOS / Linux：</p>\n<pre><code>cp -R muyang-illustration-skills/skills/muyang-* ~/.codex/skills/\n</code></pre>\n<p>Windows PowerShell：</p>\n<pre><code>Copy-Item -Recurse -Force .\\muyang-illustration-skills\\skills\\muyang-* \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.codex\\skills\\\"\n</code></pre>\n<p>安装后新建一个 Codex 任务或刷新技能列表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"使用\">使用</h2>\n<p>通过总入口：</p>\n<pre><code>$muyang-illustration\n主体：一只白色的猫躺在狗身上\n风格：庭院手绘插画\n</code></pre>\n<p>直接调用子技能：</p>\n<pre><code>$muyang-fashion-colorblock\n主体：一个20岁的女性穿着短裙和白色T恤\n风格：黄黑撞色插画\n画幅：9:16\n</code></pre>\n<p>若缺少主体或具体风格，Skill 会先询问；信息齐全后直接生成图片。</p>\n<h2 id=\"skill-一览\">Skill 一览</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Skill</th>\n<th>风格</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>muyang-illustration</code></td>\n<td>总入口：路由全部 25 种风格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>muyang-editorial-minimal</code></td>\n<td>精致极简、极简现代、极简冰蓝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>muyang-fashion-colorblock</code></td>\n<td>蓝白时尚、韩系蓝白、黄黑撞色、粉蓝撞色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>muyang-soft-dream</code></td>\n<td>复古柔焦、柔焦烟灰、梦幻鎏金、梦幻彩虹、柔焦霓虹</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>muyang-white-couture</code></td>\n<td>柔纱纯白、华丽银灰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>muyang-dark-fashion</code></td>\n<td>暗调黑红、暗黑韩系、暗黑冷光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>muyang-oriental-poetry</code></td>\n<td>庭院手绘、东方青绿、极简墨灰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>muyang-print-poster</code></td>\n<td>复古剪影、复古电影、日式版画</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>muyang-cinematic-narrative</code></td>\n<td>清冷夏日、童话巨宠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"25-种插画风格\">25 种插画风格</h2>\n<h2 id=\"一极简编辑插画\">一、极简编辑插画</h2>\n<p>由 <code>muyang-editorial-minimal</code> 提供。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风格</th>\n<th>视觉特点</th>\n<th>示意图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2061644933287838180\">精致极简插画</a></td>\n<td>干净流畅线条、柔和中性色、大面积留白，以少量亮色聚焦视觉。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-editorial-minimal/assets/01-minimal-magazine.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"精致极简插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2062773407020937534\">极简现代插画</a></td>\n<td>北欧与韩系编辑线描，奶白、鼠尾草绿和墨黑色块结合旧纸颗粒。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-editorial-minimal/assets/04-modern-editorial.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"极简现代插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2070084443793166792\">极简冰蓝插画</a></td>\n<td>冰蓝冷调、优雅线条、抽象几何与半透明叠层，现代而清冷。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-editorial-minimal/assets/20-ice-blue-editorial.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"极简冰蓝插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"二撞色时装插画\">二、撞色时装插画</h2>\n<p>由 <code>muyang-fashion-colorblock</code> 提供。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风格</th>\n<th>视觉特点</th>\n<th>示意图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2062435248231817530\">蓝白时尚插画</a></td>\n<td>蓝白骨架配色、锐利大色块、冷蓝硬边阴影与高级日系封面感。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-fashion-colorblock/assets/03-blue-white-fashion.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"蓝白时尚插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2063826058072465747\">韩系蓝白插画</a></td>\n<td>韩系商业视觉、半写实二次元、大面积高纯色块与强品牌识别度。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-fashion-colorblock/assets/08-korean-colorblock.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"韩系蓝白插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2064248645369905614\">黄黑撞色插画</a></td>\n<td>明黄与纯黑强对比、硬边阴影、醒目克制的时尚杂志封面。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-fashion-colorblock/assets/11-yellow-black-fashion.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"黄黑撞色插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2073774407181643780\">粉蓝撞色插画</a></td>\n<td>珊瑚粉天空、海军蓝阴影与深青中间色，融合日系时装和旅行海报。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-fashion-colorblock/assets/23-pink-blue-travel.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"粉蓝撞色插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三柔焦梦幻插画\">三、柔焦梦幻插画</h2>\n<p>由 <code>muyang-soft-dream</code> 提供。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风格</th>\n<th>视觉特点</th>\n<th>示意图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2062892619458592977\">复古柔焦插画</a></td>\n<td>低饱和复古水粉、暖灰雾粉、斑驳树影与被阳光漂白的旧画报感。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-soft-dream/assets/05-retro-softfocus.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"复古柔焦插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2063982747946009064\">柔焦烟灰插画</a></td>\n<td>冷灰绿雾化背景、冷白侧逆光、纸面纹理与清冷忧郁氛围。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-soft-dream/assets/09-smoke-gray.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"柔焦烟灰插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2065001375898243959\">梦幻鎏金插画</a></td>\n<td>黄昏金色轮廓光与深海蓝阴影形成蓝橙对比，浪漫而怀旧。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-soft-dream/assets/13-golden-dream.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"梦幻鎏金插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2066465364146630742\">梦幻彩虹插画</a></td>\n<td>粉蓝紫虹彩折射、高曝光柔光、半透明材质和空灵幻想质感。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-soft-dream/assets/17-rainbow-dream.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"梦幻彩虹插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2074857375329386732\">柔焦霓虹插画</a></td>\n<td>青蓝环境与暖橙粉光线交织，带水汽、折射、胶片颗粒和梦幻失焦。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-soft-dream/assets/25-neon-softfocus.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"柔焦霓虹插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"四纯白高定插画\">四、纯白高定插画</h2>\n<p>由 <code>muyang-white-couture</code> 提供。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风格</th>\n<th>视觉特点</th>\n<th>示意图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2063139225428431118\">柔纱纯白插画</a></td>\n<td>纯白高曝光空间、百褶纱与欧根纱流动曲线，轻盈而诗意。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-white-couture/assets/06-white-chiffon.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"柔纱纯白插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2065823008712007927\">华丽银灰插画</a></td>\n<td>冰蓝白与银灰色系，薄纱、珠链、水晶和羽毛构成冷艳高定质感。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-white-couture/assets/15-silver-white-couture.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"华丽银灰插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"五暗黑时尚插画\">五、暗黑时尚插画</h2>\n<p>由 <code>muyang-dark-fashion</code> 提供。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风格</th>\n<th>视觉特点</th>\n<th>示意图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2063866436695814259\">暗调黑红插画</a></td>\n<td>黑色与暗酒红主调，猩红霓虹硬光切割，冷艳、危险而疏离。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-dark-fashion/assets/07-black-red.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"暗调黑红插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2064602027217633679\">暗黑韩系插画</a></td>\n<td>黑与冷灰的丰富暗部层次，少量暗红点缀，强调材质与商业精修感。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-dark-fashion/assets/12-dark-korean.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"暗黑韩系插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2066086016407240949\">暗黑冷光插画</a></td>\n<td>纯黑背景与局部冷白硬光，大量留黑，只保留轮廓和关键高光。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-dark-fashion/assets/16-black-coldlight.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"暗黑冷光插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"六东方诗意插画\">六、东方诗意插画</h2>\n<p>由 <code>muyang-oriental-poetry</code> 提供。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风格</th>\n<th>视觉特点</th>\n<th>示意图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2062083344083661002\">庭院手绘插画</a></td>\n<td>白墙灰瓦、繁茂绿植与斑驳树影，水彩厚涂的治愈生活气息。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-oriental-poetry/assets/02-courtyard.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"庭院手绘插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2064180291946926369\">东方青绿插画</a></td>\n<td>青绿体系、大面积留白、湖面远山与轻雾构成清冷禅意空间。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-oriental-poetry/assets/10-oriental-green.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"东方青绿插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2065361912238657858\">极简墨灰插画</a></td>\n<td>冷灰、米白与浓墨块面结合月轮、倒影和纸纹，像高级诗集封面。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-oriental-poetry/assets/14-ink-gray.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"极简墨灰插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"七复古印刷插画\">七、复古印刷插画</h2>\n<p>由 <code>muyang-print-poster</code> 提供。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风格</th>\n<th>视觉特点</th>\n<th>示意图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2068266721841172760\">复古剪影插画</a></td>\n<td>米白、炭黑、暖黄三色，剪影、木刻颗粒与大量留白形成寓言感。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-print-poster/assets/19-silhouette.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"复古剪影插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2070547539255030124\">复古电影插画</a></td>\n<td>深青、红橙与奶油白的大色块，几何建筑切面和长投影营造电影感。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-print-poster/assets/22-retro-film.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"复古电影插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2074498667739033746\">日式版画插画</a></td>\n<td>米白旧纸、深墨主体和少量鲜亮色块，融合昭和海报与木版画。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-print-poster/assets/24-japanese-print.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"日式版画插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"八电影叙事插画\">八、电影叙事插画</h2>\n<p>由 <code>muyang-cinematic-narrative</code> 提供。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风格</th>\n<th>视觉特点</th>\n<th>示意图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2067977304689816013\">清冷夏日插画</a></td>\n<td>低机位仰视、钴蓝天空、冷白硬光和强烈蓝白对比，充满夏日透明感。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-cinematic-narrative/assets/18-cool-summer.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"清冷夏日插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://x.com/yyyole/status/2070444305475571966\">童话巨宠插画</a></td>\n<td>巨大与渺小的尺度反差、温暖灰白留白与静默凝视，像艺术电影童话。</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/main/skills/muyang-cinematic-narrative/assets/21-giant-pet.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"童话巨宠插画\" /></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工作方式\">工作方式</h2>\n<pre><code>flowchart LR\n    A[用户指定主体] --&gt; B[用户选择具体风格]\n    B --&gt; C[读取固定配方]\n    C --&gt; D[仅替换主体占位符]\n    D --&gt; E[直接生成图片]\n</code></pre>\n<p>固定配方位于各子技能的 <code>references/recipes.md</code>；示意图位于对应 <code>assets/</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"仓库结构\">仓库结构</h2>\n<pre><code>muyang-illustration-skills/\n├── README.md\n├── LICENSE\n├── NOTICE.md\n└── skills/\n    ├── muyang-illustration/\n    ├── muyang-editorial-minimal/\n    ├── muyang-fashion-colorblock/\n    ├── muyang-soft-dream/\n    ├── muyang-white-couture/\n    ├── muyang-dark-fashion/\n    ├── muyang-oriental-poetry/\n    ├── muyang-print-poster/\n    └── muyang-cinematic-narrative/\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"许可证与素材说明\">许可证与素材说明</h2>\n<p>Skill 指令、提示词整理与仓库文档使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/blob/main/LICENSE\">MIT License</a>。</p>\n<p>示意图用于说明各风格的视觉效果，并保留原始发布链接。示意图不自动包含在 MIT 授权范围内；相关权利归原始权利人所有。详见 <a href=\"https://github.com/yokel1121/muyang-illustration-skills/blob/main/NOTICE.md\">NOTICE.md</a>。</p>\n","toc":[{"id":"沐阳插画-skills","text":"沐阳插画 Skills","level":2},{"id":"特点","text":"特点","level":2},{"id":"安装","text":"安装","level":2},{"id":"使用","text":"使用","level":2},{"id":"skill-一览","text":"Skill 一览","level":2},{"id":"25-种插画风格","text":"25 种插画风格","level":2},{"id":"一极简编辑插画","text":"一、极简编辑插画","level":2},{"id":"二撞色时装插画","text":"二、撞色时装插画","level":2},{"id":"三柔焦梦幻插画","text":"三、柔焦梦幻插画","level":2},{"id":"四纯白高定插画","text":"四、纯白高定插画","level":2},{"id":"五暗黑时尚插画","text":"五、暗黑时尚插画","level":2},{"id":"六东方诗意插画","text":"六、东方诗意插画","level":2},{"id":"七复古印刷插画","text":"七、复古印刷插画","level":2},{"id":"八电影叙事插画","text":"八、电影叙事插画","level":2},{"id":"工作方式","text":"工作方式","level":2},{"id":"仓库结构","text":"仓库结构","level":2},{"id":"许可证与素材说明","text":"许可证与素材说明","level":2}]},"skills":[{"name":"muyang-cinematic-narrative","description":"风格包含：清冷夏日插画、童话巨宠插画。用于收集用户指定的主体和具体风格，将主体原样填入对应固定配方并直接生成图片；不得展示提示词、扩写动作、场景或叙事。","path":"skills/muyang-cinematic-narrative"},{"name":"muyang-dark-fashion","description":"风格包含：暗调黑红插画、暗黑韩系插画、暗黑冷光插画。用于收集用户指定的主体和具体风格，将主体原样填入对应固定配方并直接生成图片；不得展示提示词、扩写、改写或混合光色。","path":"skills/muyang-dark-fashion"},{"name":"muyang-editorial-minimal","description":"风格包含：精致极简插画、极简现代插画、极简冰蓝插画。用于收集用户指定的主体和具体风格，将主体原样填入对应固定配方并直接生成图片；不得展示提示词、扩写、改写或混合风格。","path":"skills/muyang-editorial-minimal"},{"name":"muyang-fashion-colorblock","description":"风格包含：蓝白时尚插画、韩系蓝白插画、黄黑撞色插画、粉蓝撞色插画。用于收集用户指定的主体和具体风格，将主体原样填入对应固定配方并直接生成图片；不得展示提示词、扩写、改写或混合风格。","path":"skills/muyang-fashion-colorblock"},{"name":"muyang-illustration","description":"风格分类包含：极简编辑、撞色时装、柔焦梦幻、纯白高定、暗黑时尚、东方诗意、复古版画、电影叙事，共 25 种固定风格。作为沐阳插画总入口，用于收集主体和具体风格、路由到对应固定配方并直接生成图片；不向用户展示内部提示词。","path":"skills/muyang-illustration"},{"name":"muyang-oriental-poetry","description":"风格包含：庭院手绘插画、东方青绿插画、极简墨灰插画。用于收集用户指定的主体和具体风格，将主体原样填入对应固定配方并直接生成图片；不得展示提示词、扩写或增加东方意象。","path":"skills/muyang-oriental-poetry"},{"name":"muyang-print-poster","description":"风格包含：复古剪影插画、复古电影插画、日式版画插画。用于收集用户指定的主体和具体风格，将主体原样填入对应固定配方并直接生成图片；不得展示提示词、扩写或改变色数。","path":"skills/muyang-print-poster"},{"name":"muyang-soft-dream","description":"风格包含：复古柔焦插画、柔焦烟灰插画、梦幻鎏金插画、梦幻彩虹插画、柔焦霓虹插画。用于收集用户指定的主体和具体风格，将主体原样填入对应固定配方并直接生成图片；不得向用户展示提示词。","path":"skills/muyang-soft-dream"},{"name":"muyang-white-couture","description":"风格包含：柔纱纯白插画、华丽银灰插画。用于收集用户指定的主体和具体风格，将主体原样填入对应固定配方并直接生成图片；不得展示提示词、扩写或改写。","path":"skills/muyang-white-couture"}],"skillCount":9,"marketplace":false,"plugin":false,"docker":false,"npm":null,"pypi":null,"install":{},"releases":[],"contributors":[{"login":"yokel1121","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81351415?v=4","n":4}]}
